{"3959430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "动物城大法官", "steam_appid": 3959430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959430/extras/0fad79f1495a2bfadbb11e3c23ae5291.poster.avif?t=1765542795\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959430/extras/0fad79f1495a2bfadbb11e3c23ae5291.webm?t=1765542795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959430/extras/0fad79f1495a2bfadbb11e3c23ae5291.mp4?t=1765542795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家将化身动物城新晋大法官审理动物城大小案件，在审理过程中需要：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>调查真相</strong>​：搜集现场证物、记录目击者证言，甚至从《动物日报》的新闻中挖掘隐藏线索。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959430/extras/cb4c8922920ccafed5261454de84298e.poster.avif?t=1765542795\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959430/extras/cb4c8922920ccafed5261454de84298e.webm?t=1765542795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959430/extras/cb4c8922920ccafed5261454de84298e.mp4?t=1765542795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>法庭博弈</strong>​：倾听原告与被告的诉求，分析证词逻辑矛盾，用追问机制揭穿谎言。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959430/extras/70cce36ed6aa5ee9e26e0ab8cf94202a.poster.avif?t=1765542795\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https: